# V7.9 Work Package D1 — PERSISTENT UFO/UIA IMPLEMENTATION-READY REVIEW PATCH
# Date: 2026-09-09
# Scope: replace per-command Python/UFO/COM startup with one serialized persistent worker.
# Safety invariants:
# - host /gui-input-check remains authoritative before every mutation;
# - READ may recycle + retry once after worker loss;
# - mutation flushed without response => OUTCOME_UNKNOWN and is never replayed;
# - stdout is protocol-only NDJSON; dependency noise is ignored, not treated as a result;
# - no generic macro/shell/raw action surface is added.
